<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN FLORIDIENNE H1 NET RISES SHARPLY.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN FLORIDIENNE H1 NET RISES SHARPLY.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit	  15.0 (13.6) vs   0.2</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	   18.0 (16.1) vs   4.0</p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales    1,017 ( 914) vs 1,071</p>
<p>    Cash flow		   64.6 (66.7) vs  70.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Floridienne, a Belgian holding company with interests</p>
<p>in the chemical and agri-foods sectors, said part of the</p>
<p>increases were due to a wider scope of consolidation. The</p>
<p>figures in brackets () represent unchanged consolidation.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
